1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:07,760
This was what was going on there, but I knew that it could not continue forever because most of this stuff is unconscious.

2
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:13,680
It's not racism in the sense of, I think black people are bad and ugly.

3
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:18,240
It's more like tribalism. I want my team to win and your team can, you know.

4
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,500
Functionally, it's the same thing.

5
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:28,440
There's no functional difference between get out of my lifeboat, nigga, and I'm so sorry, but this boat is reserved for white people.

